WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.810
Come here quickly!

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:03.020
Come here immediately!

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.730
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:17.030
Say bye-bye to the teacher after class!

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.540
And bring back your gym clothes!

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.370
Wanna gather at the schoolyard to play?

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.170
Aren't you gonna give a good excuse?

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.710
Just leave that homework alone!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.680
Let's swing around the metal bars instead!

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:39.760
That red backpack sure is strong

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.350
One, two, line up in threes!

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.890
And dash forward with the pencil case after school!

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:49.940
You'll forget about it, so cheer up!

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:49.940
One

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:49.940
Two!

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.440
Hey Mr.! Turn around that corner!

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.740
Let's have a large assembly in the schoolyard!

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.080
Just who am I?

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:05.000
Can I still have fun when I grow up?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.710
I don't know, but I just wanna know!

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:15.050
If we can still laugh over the small matters

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:19.640
I'm happy enough with that!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.350
This! That! And everything else!

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:27.190
Let the three of us play 'til we drop!

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:36.110
Good morning!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.200
Morning!

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.210
Hello, everyone!

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:51.960
I was finally able to fulfill my heart's desire and become a school teacher!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.920
I am the greenhorn, Yabe Satoshi!

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.170
It's my pleasure to work with everyone, please take of me!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.550
I'm Kuriyama Aiko, the infirmary nurse.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.260
Please take care of me.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.850
My glasses... My glasses...!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:06.480
Eh...?

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.690
They're right here, Miss Kuriyama!

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.940
Ah, thank you very much.

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:13.270
Y-You're welcome.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.910
The class I'll be in charge of is Class 6-3.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.330
No matter what kind of children they are, I'm looking forward to meeting them.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:45.390
The Marui Family! The Good, The Bad and The Scary!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.620
Can you keep on going?

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:05.700
Of course!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.290
We gotta do this to survive, you know!

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.080
That's right.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.460
Before we're done in, let's defeat her at least!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.960
Let's do this!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.510
There's no end to this!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.390
This is... This is...

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.390
This is what war is!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.990
C'mon now, where's my next opponent?!

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.330
H-Hold on a second!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.990
This isn't a war at all!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.000
It's supposed to be "Anything Goes", isn't it?!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.830
Ah? It's not this kind of game?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.460
It's completely different!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.800
"Anything Goes":

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:01.090
After arranging chairs for all but one in a circle, everyone tries for a chair.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:03.260
The one who fails to do so will become "it".

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.260
Then...

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.510
"Those with glasses!"

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:10.520
All those who match the type declared by "it" must then change seats,

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:16.480
and the person left without a chair is the next "it".

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.020
"Anything goes!"

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:23.450
Then, when a person says "anything goes", everyone has to change seats.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.820
If one becomes "it" three times, he'll receive a penalty.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.030
That makes it more motivating and enjoyable, right?

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:33.250
Those who are penalized will have their homework tripled!

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:39.920
Although this idea was supposed to have a reasonable reception,

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.340
it mistakenly turned into a violent riot.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.140
But it's still too early to be surprised.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.850
That's because, in this class...

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.640
I am humbly ashamed!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.600
With the intention of showing you my good side, I went overboard.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.060
I have always been living my life to the fullest!

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.900
I'll reflect on this!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.190
Y-You don't have to prostrate yourself!

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.440
Well, she's quite the honest child though, isn't she?

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.070
Huh?!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.320
This is how you're supposed to prostrate yourself.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.160
Right?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.540
Wait a sec! What are you doing?!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.210
Speaking of which, where's the other one?

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.460
Can you please participate in this?!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.720
In this class, there are three students who're famed for their notoriety.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.340
Japan's most unlike triplets...

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.510
The three Marui sisters!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.430
I've completed my self-reflection!

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.100
I can see those bunny panties of yours!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.690
They aren't bunny panties!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.020
Gosh, you girls should be doing self-reflection now, shouldn't you?

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.240
Well, I was <i>reflecting</i> on the color of the panties!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.120
I found myself an empty seat!

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.120
Making my way, making my way~

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:53.330
Oh no, I better not let my guard down.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.370
Eh?

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.830
Sign: Marui Futaba (Middle Sister)
A slightly perverted and masochistic girl

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.670
Where's "it"?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:06.550
That's strange... We did gather enough chairs for all except one, right?

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.880
Board: Welcome <3 Yabe-Sensei!
April 7th, Wednesday.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.140
Woah, Mitsuba! You can't sit on your classmate like that!

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:17.640
Sheesh. It's of great honor for one to become my chair, you know.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.860
Even if it's for honor, it's not right!

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.110
You're quite the insolent dog, aren't you?!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.650
I'm the teacher, you know!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.530
What are you doing?! Come on!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.450
Ah! That's unfair!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.070
Marui Mitsuba (Eldest Sister)
A bit of the precocious but sadistic girl

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.080
In the world of making use of minions, the winner would be yours truly!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.500
Well, then... Those with their hair tied up?

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.050
Hey, yours is tied up too!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.730
That's unfair! That's foul play, you know!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.150
Yabe-chi, she's violating the rules!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.900
Yabe-chi...?

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.150
Ah... Well, that aside...

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.940
Come on. Let's not cheat!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.530
Erm...

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.410
Lucky~

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.320
Um...

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.280
Hitoha?

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.540
Absolute disregard?!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.620
Come on now, you're always reading that book...

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.790
Time to confiscate-

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.000
Eh?! What incredible strength...

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.010
Er, I-I'm sorry...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.510
Really, I'm sorry!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.430
I seriously apologize!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:08:02.920
Marui Hitoha (Youngest Sister)
A somewhat dark mysterious girl

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.490
Hitoha is "it"! Nyahaha!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:57.870
Is it my fault...?

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.040
What you call out should be interesting, huh?!

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.550
My friends.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.470
Well then, "anything goes..."

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.680
Wait! I'm your friend!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.560
Crap, I'm "it" again, huh?

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.230
Um, I wonder what I should do...

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.940
Hurry up and decide already!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.240
Ah, well then. How about...

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.200
Those who have Marui as their last name!

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.200
Alright!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.950
Give me what you've got!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.750
Why are you two taking this seriously?!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.710
As for you, can't you be more serious?!

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.140
W-What's with this atmosphere?

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.340
Sign: Grade 6, Section 3
Marudan Hitoha

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.940
Ah, Futaba, there are some boobs outside!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.400
Eh?! Where are they?!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.110
What a simpleton.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:15.280
Huh?! You deceived me, didn't you?!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:29.710
Ah, what the... What's wrong, Mitsu?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.210
What should I do?

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.630
Should I hand it over?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:38.840
No, wait... Even if I were to give in, I would lose the chance to catch her eye again!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.600
I must show my dignity as a teacher here!

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.310
I'm so sorry, Hitoha!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.230
T-This... is...

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:02.240
My eyes can't take any more...

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.080
A-A daily housewife's...

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.960
...daydream?

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:18.930
Why do I have to do everyone's homework?!

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.970
Everyone, I wonder if I can survive and continue to be a proper teacher at this school...

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:39.110
Let's play together!

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:39.700
Come now! Come now!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:43.910
Give us proper service as our homeroom teacher already!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.990
You're tightening my neck too much-

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:49.790
I'll bow down to whatever you wish for, so please...!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.170
Um, Mr Yabe?

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.420
Ah, yes?!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.420
What's the matter, Miss Kuriyama?

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:02.090
You get along with your students so well, don't you?

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.550
Er, that's not so...

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.470
What's with that cord?

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.060
Ah, it's just a neck tie, a plain one really.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.600
It's a gift from my father, I guess...

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.480
It's a romance!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.570
Indeed.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.450
I wonder if we can do something to make them closer...

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:23.910
That's impossible.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.370
He's a total virgin after all.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.160
Why do you say that?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:31.120
That's just how it is for a stingy guy like him.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.290
That's how it is, huh?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:36.710
Then, I want to give Yabe-chi the chance to drink up Kuriyama's sweet nectar!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.020
You're just hopeless, aren't you?!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.230
Come on, Hitoha! Think of an idea too!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.990
She's gotten some insight now, huh?

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.280
Kuriyamachi is an infirmary nurse.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.120
That means...

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.620
It's as though I've been "severely frozen" here!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.420
How terrible! I'll apply treatment right away!

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.920
This is so shameful...

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:20.010
W-What incredibly fabulous southern sweets!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.090
That was great, Aiko.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.220
That can't be!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.550
That's love tied by the nether regions for you!

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:26.850
What kind of love is that?!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:28.970
Hey, there. What are you folks talkin' about?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.780
W-What are you trying to do?!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:50.290
I missed, huh?

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:53.210
Next time, I won't miss again!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.590
What are you doing?!

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:03.840
For the sake of Yabe-chi's romance, I'm aiming for his crotch!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:07.760
If you aim for <i>that</i>, he'll end up being on the brink of a total sex change!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.140
Hey there~

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:16.350
Well, that may be one possibility, but if it's done carefully, it should be okay!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.940
Oh~ For the sake of making this love tied by the nether region!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.900
That's very unconvincing, you know.

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.400
Erm, well. Now's not the time for talk.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.400
Let's go, Hitoha!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:30.030
Gosh, this is why it's annoying to have stupid little sisters like this!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.160
Even though I'm this honorable and adorable too!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.250
Then, by generally just aiming for his crotch...

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.420
Ah! I won't be able to go after this?!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:36.870
You damned dog!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.880
Love won't just come to...

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.340
Man, that Futaba...

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.770
You too, Hitoha?! What are you trying to do?!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.980
Alright!!!

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:02.940
You're pretty good, huh?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.110
What the hell are you guys up to?

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.910
Why are you aiming for my crotch, anyway?! If you've got a reason for it, please just tell me-

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.030
Take this, virgin boy!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.580
That was disappointing...!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.920
I was so close too!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.710
No... no more!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.960
Chase after him, you guys!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.510
Yabe-chi, wait for us!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.560
Whatever in the world is with this?!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.850
Why are they're aiming for my crotch, anyway?!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.640
Let's try some crafty and refreshing abuse, Yabe-chi!

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:42.520
Insolent dogs like you should endure pains such as that!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.940
Become one of my friends...!

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.570
I don't want this!!!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.820
This is really for your own good, Yabe-chi!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.820
Really, what did I deserve to have to deal with this-whoa!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.370
Gl-Glasses...

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.410
This is what Yabe has as his image of the worst case scenario.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.330
Yabe-chi!!!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.420
Well, this result is acceptable too.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.460
That's so boring! I wanted to make this situation for him, after all!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.920
Ah, Kuriyama-chi!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.930
Please, pass some treatment for his crotch!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.100
Hurry up and undress!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.350
Eh? Well...

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.860
I'm really sorry about this!

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.320
So, which grade are you from?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.870
She still doesn't recognize him?!

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.410
Her glasses... Where are her glasses exactly?!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.870
Umm...

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.710
Are you a fourth grader?

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.930
It's Mitsudomoe!

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:55.970
It's Mitsudomoe!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.390
That's so cute~

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.350
Please allow me to pet it as well!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.020
It's eating a seed!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.560
Aww, those cheeks are so fluffy!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.530
Our class, 6-3, had decided to buy a hamster.

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.240
Well, I was the one who bought it though...

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:17.080
It would be nice if the children would learn the importance of life and the joy of caring for others.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.620
Wow, it's really cute!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.250
I just wanna crush and squeeze it...!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.290
Hitoha, have you taken a liking to it?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.130
Well then, we'll leave the babysitting tasks to Hitoha, alright?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.510
Teacher, what's this guy's name, anyway?

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.300
It still doesn't have one.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.680
Okay! So, Boobies would do!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.680
Er-Why's that?!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.220
After you pet its tail like this, with your eyes closed...

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.430
It feels almost like a nipple!

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:44.190
You have such a wild imagination!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.900
Do so too, Hitoha!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:52.650
Nipples...

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.570
It seems as though you like it, huh?

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.700
Enough already, you perverted sisters!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:03.000
From then on, Hitoha has taken care of the hamster with compassion and enthusiasm.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:08.040
From what I could see, that dark aura of hers when I first met her has begun to lighten up.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.420
Yabe-chi.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.300
It's just that...

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:19.180
It's just that Nipples has become somewhat strange...

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.850
No! I can't really do anything to help you there...!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:29.230
Ah, <i>that</i> Nipples, huh?

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.270
It's not doing so well.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:35.650
It doesn't really eat and leave its room much.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:41.330
Could it be due to an environment change or fatigue resulting from excessive patting?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.960
Well, don't worry about it that much, it should be fine-

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.380
Oh no, it's not your fault, Hitoha...

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.760
That's right! The one who's at fault for treating it too roughly is Mitsu!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.890
That's obviously just a joke, you know!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:04.390
It's alright. It should get better in no time!

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:10.060
Nipples!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:10.980
Get well soon!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:11.690
Ouch!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:11.940
Augh!

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:12.190
Eek!

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.780
What are you doing, you third-rate sister?!

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:19.030
That's right! Why won't you just let us check on its condition-!

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:26.870
Jackpot! There are some nice boobs here!~

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.120
Impossible! How could Futaba be defeated so easily?!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.290
I really don't know, either. But, out of the triplets, the strongest was the youngest one, right?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:37.300
Th-The page... Please let me quickly see the next page already...!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.470
Fine, we get it already!

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:45.220
Still not yet?! Turn the page for me already, Hitoha!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.390
So, you got a hamster for the class, huh?

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:52.270
Yes. Well, originally it was bought for myself, but...

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:00.450
What are you doing?!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:02.620
You perverted teacher!

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.240
Kya!

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:06.240
That's not right, Miss Kuriyama!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.630
So, were you really hiding there all along?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:17.010
Erm, so, what is it? Do you want some advice?

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:25.140
Nipples will be taken care of in my own house

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:22.890
So, that is how it is...

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.600
What happened earlier must have been a misunderstanding, eh?

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.940
Chikubi will be taken care of at my own house.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.480
I better apologize to Mr Yabe...

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.780
I want to touch Nipples some more!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.820
N-Nipples...?

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.200
Don't mess with us! Are you claiming Nipples for yourself?

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.660
I want to pet Nipples much more closely!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.080
I want to keep on looking after Nipples too!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.540
Recently, Nipples hasn't looked very well, eh?

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.960
Everyone...

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:54.040
Not only did they pet it excessively,

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.460
they pinched it roughly too.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.050
It's become more distressed.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.090
That's because all of you were holding and petting my Nipples!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:07.140
What do you mean yours? It belongs to everyone, right?!

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:09.850
We've been handling it with care too!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:12.310
We've all been watching over Nipples till it got sick too!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:22.950
If you massage it gently like this, Nipples enjoys it, you know.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.200
Yabe-chi, how about drafting a roster for looking after Nipples?

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.740
Ah, that would be nice, indeed.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:34.210
Hitoha, why don't you try to trust everyone else a bit more?

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:38.040
You can entrust your Nipples with me!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.210
That's right! Believe in us, okay?!

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.050
Me too!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.380
Let's protect Nipples altogether!

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:54.600
Nipples!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:58.820
Everyone else probably loves Nipples as much as you do.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.570
And of course, me too!

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.740
Nipples...

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.320
It rose?

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:09.490
It stood up!

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.160
Nipples finally erected!

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:19.290
It's alright to touch Nipples, right?

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.090
Yup.

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:33.020
The matter's settled, I suppose.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.150
You all-round pervert!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.740
You're just the best, Nipples!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:51.830
Let me snuggle, I mean, touch it as well!

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:22.110
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:27.400
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:32.620
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:37.870
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:43.420
Let's go to sleep

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:47.380
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:54.470
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:59.390
You can even fly into the sky

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:13.950
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:14.030 --> 00:23:19.370
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:28.210
Who would have thought that this would become an anime, huh?

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.930
Well, now that it's anime, I can collect some manservants, eh?

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:35.810
Next time, those three girls won't stop!
Do look forward to that!

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:38.350
Why didn't anyone stop them, I wonder?
